# Alterac Mountains (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Alterac: the Tarren Mill elixir and battle
# chains, the Durnholde rescue, the Dalaran and Crown work, the Shaman
# elements, the cooking bisque and the venom line (band 20-45; L55 2938
# and the L50-52 Shaman chain ride as noted exceptions). Every accept is
# on key 1416; Hillsbrad, Arathi, Barrens, Durotar, Thunder Bluff,
# Orgrimmar, Undercity and Thousand Needles legs ride honest expedition
# steps below. See docs/alterac-horde-census.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/alterac-horde
title Alterac Mountains (Horde)
levels 20-45
zone Alterac Mountains
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Tarren Mill, mustering

  note Tarren Mill is the Horde hub: High Executor Darthalia (61.1, 82.1), Apothecary Lydon (60.1, 80.7) and Krusk (62.2, 82.5) hold the rise. Take the hub's asks here; the foothills fill them. The Kolkar work waits on the Barrens pre below; the Crown work waits on a Silverpine pre; the venom line's middle links live outside this tracker's list.
  goto 61.1,82.1
  accept 496 -- Elixir of Suffering - Apothecary Lydon; ten Gray Bear Tongues and Creeper Ichor, south
  note 496's tongues and ichor fill on the southern sweep below - hand them in on the return.
  accept 501 -- Elixir of Pain - Apothecary Lydon; ten Mountain Lion Blood, south
  note 501's blood fills on the southern sweep below - hand it in on the return.
  accept 527 -- Battle of Hillsbrad - High Executor Darthalia; farmers, farmhands and Ray, south; Getz rides Hillsbrad, late
  note 527's south-farm kills fill on the southern sweep below - Getz is a Hillsbrad touch, noted on the expedition leg.
  accept 549 -- WANTED: Syndicate Personnel - the WANTED board; ten Rogues and ten Watchmen, Hillsbrad camp, late
  note 549's board stands in Tarren Mill - its camp fills on the Hillsbrad leg below; 566 opens on the return.
  accept 567 -- Dangerous! - the Dangerous! board; four named Hillsbrad kills, late
  note 567's board stands in Tarren Mill - its four fill on the Hillsbrad town leg below.
  accept 552 -- Helcular's Revenge - Novice Thaivand; Helcular's Rod off the Yetis, west
  note 552's rod fills on the western sweep below - 553 opens on the return.
  accept 556 -- Stone Tokens - Keeper Bel'varil; ten Worn Stone Tokens off the Dalaran guard, west
  note 556's tokens fill on the western sweep below - 557 opens on the return.
  accept 544 -- Prison Break In - Magus Voidglare; four Bloodstones off the Durnholde traitors, north
  note 544's bloodstones fill on the northern sweep below - 545 opens on the return.
  accept 1361 -- Regthar Deathgate - Krusk; speak with Regthar in the Barrens, late
  note 1361's turn-in is a Barrens expedition - the leg below carries it.
  accept 1066 -- Blood of Innocents - Apothecary Lydon; five Vials of Innocent Blood, Hillsbrad camp, late
  note 1066 needs 1065 (Mulgore-accept, uncontracted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; holders use the mini below.
  accept 2480 only Rogue -- Hinott's Assistance - Serge Hinott; wait for the cure at the Hillsbrad point, late
  note 2480 needs 2479 (Orgrimmar-accept, uncontracted) done and Rogue hands - take it here if that leg sent you in; holders use the mini below.
  accept 535 -- Valik - Henchman Valik's camp; a mug of Southshore Stout
  note 535 rides its parent 533's line - take it here; its stout fills on the western sweep below.
  accept 518 -- The Crown of Will - Melisara; ten Crushridge Maulers, north-east
  note 518 needs 495 (Silverpine-accept, uncontracted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; its maulers fill on the northern sweep below.
  accept 498 -- The Rescue - Krusk; Drull and Tog'thar in Durnholde cages, Hillsbrad east, late
  note 498's cages sit across the Hillsbrad line - take it here; the rescue leg below carries it; 533 opens on its return.
  accept 509 -- Elixir of Agony - Apothecary Lydon; six Mudsnout Blossoms, Hillsbrad, late
  note 509's blossoms sit across the Hillsbrad line - take it here; the south-center leg below carries it; 513 opens on its return.
  accept 517 -- Elixir of Agony - Apothecary Lydon; a Keg of Shindigger Stout, Dun Garok, late
  note 517 needs 515 (Undercity-accept, uncontracted) done - take it here if that leg sent you in; its keg fills on the Dun Garok leg below.
  accept 547 -- Humbert's Sword - Deathguard Humbert; the sword off the Dun Garok line, late
  note 547's sword fills on the Dun Garok leg below - hand it in on the return.
  accept 676 -- The Hammer May Fall - Tallow; Boulderfist Ogres in Arathi, late
  note 676's ogres and turn-in sit in Arathi - the expedition leg below carries it.
  accept 2934 -- Undamaged Venom Sac - Apothecary Lydon; the sac off the Hinterlands Broodguard, late
  note 2934 needs 2933 (Hinterlands, starter-unknown, uncontracted) - take it here if that trail sent you in; its sac fills on the Hinterlands leg below.
  note 2938 waits on uncontracted 2937 (Durotar-accept) - take it at the handoff below if that leg sent you in; its turn-in rides the Undercity leg.

step Tarren Mill, the Lydon pre

  when onquest 1065
  goto 60.1,80.7
  turnin 1065 -- Journey to Tarren Mill - Zamah's word to Apothecary Lydon
  accept 1066 -- Blood of Innocents - Apothecary Lydon; five Vials of Innocent Blood, Hillsbrad camp, late
  note Holders of 1065 turn in here first, then take 1066 on the same terms as the muster above. 1065 accepts in Mulgore and lives outside this tracker's list.

step Tarren Mill, the Hinott pre

  when onquest 2479
  goto 60.3,80.9
  turnin 2479 -- Hinott's Assistance - Rumstag's word to Serge Hinott
  accept 2480 only Rogue -- Hinott's Assistance - Serge Hinott; wait for the cure at the Hillsbrad point, late
  note Holders of 2479 turn in here first, then take the Rogue-only 2480 on the same terms as the muster above. 2479 accepts in Orgrimmar and lives outside this tracker's list.

step South - the border farms

  collect 3476 x10 @51.85,69.12 era -- ten Gray Bear Tongues off the bears for Apothecary Lydon, south
  note The bears range the south around (36-55, 69-99) - work the hills for all ten tongues.
  collect 3477 @51.3,74.5 era -- Creeper Ichor off the Forest Moss Creepers for Apothecary Lydon, south
  note The creepers work around (51-55, 70-75) - take the ichor with the tongues.
  collect 3496 x10 @39,99.4 era -- ten Mountain Lion Blood off the lions for Apothecary Lydon, far south
  note The lions range the far south around (29-46, 88-99) - work the flats for all ten vials.
  complete 527 @25,98.9 era -- six Hillsbrad Farmers for High Executor Darthalia, on the border farms
  complete 527 @27.8,98.7 era -- Farmer Ray for High Executor Darthalia, on the border farms
  note The border farms sit right on the line around (24-28, 98-99) - Getz works the Hillsbrad side and rides the expedition leg below.
  note The skulls wait for 546's accept on the return below - farm them on the dedicated trip after that.

