  turnin 499 -- Elixir of Suffering - the elixir to Umpi
  turnin 501 -- Elixir of Pain - the blood to Apothecary Lydon
  accept 502 -- Elixir of Pain - Apothecary Lydon; feed the elixir to Stanley, far south-west
  note 502 waited on 501's turn-in - Stanley waits on the western sweep below.
  turnin 527 -- Battle of Hillsbrad - the farm dead to High Executor Darthalia
  accept 528 -- Battle of Hillsbrad - High Executor Darthalia; fifteen Hillsbrad Peasants, Southshore, late
  note 528 waited on 527's turn-in - its peasants fill on the Hillsbrad leg below.
  accept 546 -- Souvenirs of Death - Deathguard Samsa; thirty Hillsbrad Human Skulls
  note 546 waited on 527's turn-in - its skulls fill on the trip below; hand them in on the return after that.

