step Bath'rah the Windwatcher - the Shaman chain

  only Shaman

  goto 80.5,66.92
  note Bath'rah holds the elements chain for Shaman: 8411 (Air, Earth, Fire, Water), 8412 (Spider Eyes, Thick Claws), 8413 (voodoo feathers). None of the reagents names a placed source anywhere in the data - have them all in your bags: Elemental Air 7067, Elemental Earth 7066, Elemental Fire 7068, Elemental Water 7070, Bloodshot Spider Eye 20610 x8, Thick Black Claw 20611 x8, Amber/Green/Blue Voodoo Feather 20606/20608/20607 x2 each.
  accept 8411 only Shaman -- Mastering the Elements - Bath'rah the Windwatcher; the four elements
  turnin 8411 only Shaman -- Mastering the Elements - the elements to Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  accept 8412 only Shaman -- Spirit Totem - Bath'rah the Windwatcher; eyes and claws
  turnin 8412 only Shaman -- Spirit Totem - the pieces to Bath'rah the Windwatcher
